  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Support to Philippine Nationally Determined Contribution (NDC) Project assists the Government ofthe Philippines (GoP) in advancing its climate goals by establishing net-zero and climate-resilientdevelopment pathways aligned with the Paris Agreement. The project supports the enhancement of thecountry&#x2019;s NDC through a five-step process: scoping, baseline updates, sector assessments, cross-cuttinganalyses, and drafting NDC revisions. Key outputs include input documents for the NDC 3.0 in the was</narrative>
  </description>
